# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout, regardless of
# the developer's local core.autocrlf setting. Without this, core.autocrlf=true
# on Windows makes Git flag files like .gitkeep as "modified" even when the
# working tree and the committed blob are byte-identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.shp binary
*.shx binary
*.dbf binary
*.prj binary
*.cpg binary
*.img binary
*.npz binary
